02:16:18.712 --> 02:16:20.714
[instrumental music]

02:16:29.723 --> 02:16:32.225
I can't believe it, Ross.
This sucks!

02:16:32.558 --> 02:16:34.602
I mean, I don't get it.
I mean, you just got him.

02:16:34.602 --> 02:16:36.020
