02:17:36.831 --> 02:17:38.333
so, so that's a possibility

02:17:38.375 --> 02:17:40.834
Yeah, but that's, like,
two blocks away from the beach

02:17:40.834 --> 02:17:42.127
I mean, it's a
total party zoo.

02:17:42.420 --> 02:17:44.089
Oh.

02:17:51.846 --> 02:17:54.014
