just a pet to me.

02:19:30.736 --> 02:19:34.531
You've, you've been
more like a be.. Okay.

02:19:35.075 --> 02:19:36.618
Marcel, would you..

02:19:36.785 --> 02:19:38.828
Marcel, would you.. Ple,
would you leave my leg alone?

02:19:38.952 --> 02:19:42.039
Would you just stop humping me
for two seconds?

02:19:42.290 --> 02:19:43.792
Marcel, would you,
okay, would you..

02:19:43.833 --> 02:19:45.794
Just take him away,
Just take him.

02:19:51.758 --> 02:19:52.842
Ooh, oh, give me.

02:19:53.718 --> 02:19:55.845
Can you see me
operating a drill press?

02:19:57.013 --> 02:19:58.681
