02:20:20.286 --> 02:20:21.037
And they are.

02:20:23.039 --> 02:20:25.041
Hey, hey, Chan.
She could work for you.

02:20:25.875 --> 02:20:27.877
Thanks, Joey.
That's a good idea.

02:20:28.795 --> 02:20:30.964
Well.. I could. I could!
What is it?

02:20:31.714 --> 02:20:33.800
Well, my secretary is gonna be
out for a couple of weeks.

02:20:33.800 --> 02:20:35.969
She's having one of
