02:22:17.529 --> 02:22:19.072
- Ooh! I'm on.
- Okay.

02:22:21.658 --> 02:22:23.493
Mr. Bing's office.

02:22:25.995 --> 02:22:27.914
No, I'm sorry.
He's in a meeting right now.

02:22:28.414 --> 02:22:30.083
I'm not in a meeting.
I'm right-who..?

02:22:30.083 --> 02:22:32.502
