02:22:46.599 --> 02:22:49.269
Well, now I actually
have to get to work.

02:22:49.686 --> 02:22:51.604
Most likely.

02:22:51.938 --> 02:22:53.773
[laughs]

02:22:55.275 --> 02:22:57.610
- Okay, I'm gonna be out there.
- Okay.

02:22:57.610 --> 02:23:00.863
