02:23:12.500 --> 02:23:13.042
- Hey.
- Hey.

02:23:13.042 --> 02:23:14.294
- How was the first day?
- Hey.

02:23:14.502 --> 02:23:15.670
Oh! Excellent.

02:23:16.296 --> 02:23:18.423
Everyone was so, so nice!

02:23:18.506 --> 02:23:21.926
See it pays to know then
