02:25:18.918 --> 02:25:20.586
Well, you know what, Chandler

02:25:20.586 --> 02:25:22.088
I think you just gotta face it.

02:25:22.463 --> 02:25:24.298
You're like the guy
in the big office.

02:25:24.465 --> 02:25:27.969
You know? You're the one
