- Uh-huh.

02:25:32.557 --> 02:25:33.975
But they're not
your friends anymore

02:25:33.975 --> 02:25:35.643
[sighs]
But I just want--

02:25:36.144 --> 02:25:37.145
No but you can't.

02:25:37.979 --> 02:25:40.064
- But I just want--
- Nuh-uh.

02:25:42.567 --> 02:25:45.653
Monica, let's go. Come on
now people! Woman in labor!

02:25:46.028 --> 02:25:47.238
Hey Ross.
Look what I got going here.

02:25:47.280 --> 02:25:49.323
Yeah. Save it
for the cab. Okay?

02:25:50.241 --> 02:25:51.409
What are you doing?
What are you doing?

02:25:51.576 --> 02:25:52.577
We're going to a hospital

02:25:52.827 --> 02:25:53.828
What, so I can't look nice?

02:25:53.828 --> 02:25:55.246
There might be doctors there.

02:25:56.080 --> 02:25:58.666
- Joey, get out of the fridge.
- 'Alright! Alright.'

02:26:00.293 --> 02:26:01.669
