02:26:04.380 --> 02:26:07.425
- Okay. Hating this.
- Monica, come on now! Let's go!

02:26:07.467 --> 02:26:08.593
- Baby coming, god!
- I can't believe it.

02:26:08.885 --> 02:26:11.137
