02:26:15.433 --> 02:26:17.268
Well, let's go.
Come on. That's it.

02:26:18.352 --> 02:26:20.813
(Joey)
'Alright, alright.
I'm going. I'm going.'

02:26:27.445 --> 02:26:30.072
