02:27:20.248 --> 02:27:22.083
What, it's okay
when Chandler does it?

02:27:24.001 --> 02:27:25.378
You have to pick your moments

02:27:27.296 --> 02:27:28.548
Hi. Did I miss it?
Did I miss it?

02:27:28.589 --> 02:27:29.966
- No, she's not even here yet.
- Oh!

02:27:30.216 --> 02:27:31.425
What's with the guitar?

02:27:31.551 --> 02:27:33.052
Well, I just thought
we might be here for a while

02:27:33.052 --> 02:27:35.137
so, you know,
things might get musical.

02:27:35.596 --> 02:27:36.013
- Oh!
- Oh!

02:27:36.848 --> 02:27:38.224
Hey! Where the hell
have you been?

02:27:38.224 --> 02:27:39.141
Oh, we stopped at the gift shop.

02:27:39.183 --> 02:27:40.142
The gift..
Wow! Wow! Wha..

02:27:40.393 --> 02:27:41.394
I was looking at stuffed animals

02:27:41.394 --> 02:27:42.520
and Susan wanted a Chunky.

02:27:42.520 --> 02:27:42.854
Oh, Susan wanted a Chun.

02:27:43.729 --> 02:27:44.564
